---@description "미니게임 세션의 복수 입력 채널을 관리하고 공통 입력 이벤트 발행"
@Logic
@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
script MiniGameInputHubLogic extends Logic

	property string ADAPTER_MASH = "Mash"
	property string ADAPTER_TIMING = "Timing"
	property string ADAPTER_COMMAND = "Command"
	property string ADAPTER_DRAG = "Drag"
	property string DEFAULT_CHANNEL_ID = "primary"

	property string activeSessionId = ""

	-- 채널 ID별 어댑터·모듈·활성 상태
	property any activeChannels = {}
	property any activeChannelOrder = {}
	
	property boolean isRunning = false
	property boolean inputEnabled = false

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void StartInputs(string sessionId, any channelConfigs)
		-- 세션에 선언된 서로 다른 입력 어댑터를 채널별로 시작
		if self.activeSessionId ~= "" then
			self:StopInputs("restart")
		end
		if sessionId == nil or sessionId == "" or channelConfigs == nil then
			return
		end

		self.activeSessionId = sessionId
		self.activeChannels = {}
		self.activeChannelOrder = {}
		self.isRunning = false
		self.inputEnabled = false
		_MiniGameUIRouter:SetMobilePrimaryInputEnabled(false)

		local usedAdapters = {}
		for _, channelConfig in ipairs(channelConfigs) do
			local channelId = channelConfig.id or ""
			local adapterId = channelConfig.adapter or ""
			if channelId == "" or self.activeChannels[channelId] ~= nil then
				log_warning("[MiniGameInputHub] 잘못된 입력 채널 id=" .. tostring(channelId))
			elseif usedAdapters[adapterId] == true then
				log_warning("[MiniGameInputHub] 중복 입력 어댑터 adapter=" .. tostring(adapterId))
			else
				local module = self:GetModuleByAdapter(adapterId)
				local inputType = self:GetInputType(adapterId)
				if module == nil or inputType == _EMiniGameInputType.None then
					log_warning("[MiniGameInputHub] 알 수 없는 입력 어댑터 adapter=" .. tostring(adapterId))
				else
					local runtimeConfig = self:CopyConfig(channelConfig.config)
					runtimeConfig.channelId = channelId
					local entry = {
						id = channelId,
						adapter = adapterId,
						inputType = inputType,
						module = module,
						running = true,
						enabled = false
					}
					self.activeChannels[channelId] = entry
					table.insert(self.activeChannelOrder, channelId)
					usedAdapters[adapterId] = true
					module:StartModule(sessionId, runtimeConfig)
				end
			end
		end

		self.isRunning = #self.activeChannelOrder > 0
		if self.isRunning == false then
			self:ClearActive()
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void EnableInputs()
		-- 실행 중인 모든 채널의 입력 허용
		if self.isRunning == false then
			return
		end
		self.inputEnabled = true
		local usesMobilePrimaryInput = false
		for _, channelId in ipairs(self.activeChannelOrder) do
			local entry = self.activeChannels[channelId]
			if entry ~= nil and entry.running == true then
				entry.enabled = true
				if entry.adapter == self.ADAPTER_MASH or entry.adapter == self.ADAPTER_TIMING then
					usesMobilePrimaryInput = true
				end
			end
		end
		_MiniGameUIRouter:SetMobilePrimaryInputEnabled(usesMobilePrimaryInput)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method boolean IsChannelEnabled(string channelId)
		-- 지정 채널의 실행·입력 허용 상태 확인
		local entry = self.activeChannels[channelId]
		return self.isRunning == true
			and self.inputEnabled == true
			and entry ~= nil
			and entry.running == true
			and entry.enabled == true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method boolean IsRunning()
		return self.isRunning == true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void SubmitMobilePrimaryInput()
		-- 활성 채널 중 모바일 공용 입력을 사용하는 첫 채널에 전달
		for _, channelId in ipairs(self.activeChannelOrder) do
			local entry = self.activeChannels[channelId]
			if self:IsChannelEnabled(channelId) == true then
				if entry.adapter == self.ADAPTER_MASH then
					_MashInputLogic:SubmitMobileInput()
					return
				elseif entry.adapter == self.ADAPTER_TIMING then
					_TimingInputLogic:SubmitMobileInput()
					return
				end
			end
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void StopInputs(string reason)
		-- 모든 활성 입력 모듈을 중단하고 채널별 취소 이벤트 발행
		if self.activeSessionId == "" then
			return
		end
		for _, channelId in ipairs(self.activeChannelOrder) do
			local entry = self.activeChannels[channelId]
			if entry ~= nil then
				if entry.module ~= nil then
					entry.module:CancelModule()
				end
				self:EmitForChannel(channelId, _EMiniGameInputAction.Cancel, {
					isTerminal = true,
					isSuccess = false,
					reason = reason
				})
			end
		end
		self:ClearActive()
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void EmitForChannel(string channelId, integer action, any fields)
		-- 지정 채널 신호를 공통 입력 이벤트로 구성해 발행
		local entry = self.activeChannels[channelId]
		if entry == nil then
			return
		end
		local source = fields or {}
		local event = MiniGameInputEvent()
		event.sessionId = self.activeSessionId
		event.channelId = channelId
		event.inputType = entry.inputType
		event.action = action
		event.keyName = source.keyName or ""
		event.value = source.value or 0
		event.progress = source.progress or 0
		event.accuracy = source.accuracy or ""
		event.successCount = source.successCount or 0
		event.missCount = source.missCount or 0
		event.isTerminal = source.isTerminal == true
		event.isSuccess = source.isSuccess == true
		event.reason = source.reason or ""
		event.pointX = source.pointX or 0
		event.pointY = source.pointY or 0
		event.attemptsRemaining = source.attemptsRemaining or 0
		event.maxAttempts = source.maxAttempts or 0
		self:SendEvent(event)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void NotifyChannelFinished(string channelId)
		-- 완료 채널만 비활성화하고 세션 상태는 종료 요청까지 유지
		local entry = self.activeChannels[channelId]
		if entry ~= nil then
			entry.running = false
			entry.enabled = false
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method any GetModuleByAdapter(string adapterId)
		-- 입력 어댑터 식별자에 대응하는 Logic 반환
		if adapterId == self.ADAPTER_MASH then
			return _MashInputLogic
		elseif adapterId == self.ADAPTER_TIMING then
			return _TimingInputLogic
		elseif adapterId == self.ADAPTER_COMMAND then
			return _CommandInputLogic
		elseif adapterId == self.ADAPTER_DRAG then
			return _DragInputLogic
		end
		return nil
	end

	method integer GetInputType(string adapterId)
		-- 입력 어댑터 식별자를 기존 UI용 타입으로 변환
		if adapterId == self.ADAPTER_MASH then
			return _EMiniGameInputType.Mash
		elseif adapterId == self.ADAPTER_TIMING then
			return _EMiniGameInputType.Timing
		elseif adapterId == self.ADAPTER_COMMAND then
			return _EMiniGameInputType.Command
		elseif adapterId == self.ADAPTER_DRAG then
			return _EMiniGameInputType.Drag
		end
		return _EMiniGameInputType.None
	end

	method any CopyConfig(any source)
		-- 프리셋 입력 설정의 얕은 복사본 생성
		local copied = {}
		if source == nil then
			return copied
		end
		for key, value in pairs(source) do
			copied[key] = value
		end
		return copied
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void ClearActive()
		-- 활성 입력 세션과 모든 채널 상태 초기화
		_MiniGameUIRouter:SetMobilePrimaryInputEnabled(false)
		self.isRunning = false
		self.inputEnabled = false
		self.activeSessionId = ""
		self.activeChannels = {}
		self.activeChannelOrder = {}
	end

end
